  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Re-wiring India&#xbf;s digitalising economy for women&#xbf;s rights and well-being &#xbf; 
An action-oriented knowledge intervention</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the Action is to empower women workers to secure their rights in the digital economy. The specific objective is -enhanced capacity of social enterprises (Ses) to support women workers in the digital economy ii)Gender responsiveness of digital economy policies.</narrative>
